This folder holds the IP-to-location database (city.mmdb or country.mmdb).

The database itself is NOT in git — it is 8-120MB, republished monthly, and
DB-IP Lite is CC-BY licensed rather than ours to redistribute. This file is
here only so the FOLDER ships with a deploy.

Without it the folder does not exist on a new server, and
admin/migrations/geoip_install.php has to create it before it can download
anything. That works on most hosts and fails on the ones that do not let PHP
create directories — a failure that reads as "could not create includes/geoip"
and sends somebody looking at permissions for a folder that was simply never
there.

Install the database from Admin -> Traffic & Visitors -> Install it, or
download it by hand from https://db-ip.com/db/lite.php and upload it here as
city.mmdb.

Nothing in includes/ is reachable over HTTP — includes/.htaccess denies all,
and that applies to this folder too, so the database can never be served.
